        "jp_sha256": "b93d8b0d9e293dd25735f6082cb4e0287777cf15395754b44792c76f078039a8",
        "official_en_sha256": "aa13c476e74534db8b5ec4ff94bac1d0183abac1b395f010547070a1175f33b0"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "……忘れておったわい。\r\n悪い噂がどんなに出回ろうと\r\nあやつが弟子にやけに好かれておったのを……。",
        "official_en": "...I had forgotten how beloved she was by her pupils, despite her sinister repute.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
